    {
      "chunk_id": "ragchunk_7b29e69ca5274d6a",
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/02_architecture/post_h_current_architecture_map.md",
        "line_start": 176,
        "line_end": 215,
        "title": "Mapa arquitectónico actual DevPilot post-H"
      },
      "fragment": "```\n\nEstructura observada:\n\n```text\napp.py\nsecurity.py\ndependencies.py\nmodels.py\nrouters/actions.py\nrouters/approvals.py\nrouters/reports.py\nrouters/settings.py\nrouters/status.py\nrouters/traces.py\nrouters/validation.py\n```\n\nLa API debe permanecer local-first, con host local y sin exposición remota por defecto. Su rol industrial posterior debe ser servir al dashboard y UI local, no abrir una superficie enterprise prematura.\n\n### UI web\n\nLa UI web vive en:\n\n```text\nui/web\n```\n\nComponentes observados:\n\n```text\nDashboard\nReportTraceView\nApprovalCenterView\nSettingsView\nDryRunActionForm\nProviderSettings\nStatusCard\nFindingList/FindingTable\n```",
