      "fragment": "### 6.2 Observability inventory\n\nDebe reportar como mínimo:\n\n```text\ntarget_id\npath\nexists\nsize_bytes\nmodified_at\nrecords_estimated\nretention_days\nexpired\nrotation_recommended\nredaction_required\nclean_zip_excluded\nrisk_level\n```\n\n### 6.3 Cleanup plan\n\nDebe reportar:\n\n```text\nactions_total\nactions_by_kind\nwould_rotate\nwould_delete\nwould_redact\nwould_export\nmutations_performed=false en dry-run\nblocked_actions\nrequired_approval_ids si aplica\n```\n\n## 7. Principios de diseño\n\n```text\n1. Local-first: todo opera sobre archivos locales del workspace.",
