      "fragment": "\"Malformed patches crash the command.\",\n    \"The sprint enables patch apply, sandbox, ChangeSet, rollback, Git write or deploy.\"\n  ],\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"git apply --check depends on Git availability.\",\n    \"Preflight applicability is not semantic correctness.\",\n    \"Large patches need future limits and timeout tuning.\",\n    \"Patch sandbox and ChangeSet remain future Sprint 41 scope.\"\n  ],\n  \"preliminary\": true,\n  \"next_sprint\": \"FUNC-SPRINT-41 — PatchSandbox y ChangeSet model\"\n}",
