      "fragment": "\"PolicyEngine is bypassed.\",\n    \"Rollback plan is omitted.\",\n    \"Arbitrary commands, Git write, LLM calls or external APIs are enabled.\"\n  ],\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"The initial executor supports only mechanical Python text normalization.\",\n    \"Sandbox success can create a false sense of production safety if not reviewed by a human.\",\n    \"Future semantic refactors require AST-aware operations, stronger tests and approval workflows.\",\n    \"Rollback execution remains non-mutating until future restore semantics.\"\n  ],\n  \"preliminary\": true,\n  \"next_sprint\": \"FUNC-SPRINT-44 — Cierre Fase C: repository engineering quality gate\"\n}",
