e pytest, quality-gate ci y Web UI smoke.\",\n    \"No cerrar si publica, despliega o etiqueta Git.\",\n    \"No cerrar si agrega dependencias externas innecesarias.\"\n  ],\n  \"risks\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"RISK-FUNC-77-001\",",
