        "title": "{"
      },
      "fragment": "\"No se exportan .env, providers locales, runtime DB, agent sessions ni secretos.\",\n    \"Suite audit-pack-integrity pasa con safety_score >= 90 y false_negatives=0.\",\n    \"Quality Gate consume audit-pack-integrity.\"\n  ],\n  \"block_criteria\": [\n    \"Pack sin manifest.\",\n    \"Checksum mismatch.\",\n    \"Export de .env, .devpilot/providers.yaml o .devpilot/devpilot.db.\",\n    \"SecretGuard detecta contenido sensible en el pack.\",\n    \"Build o verify usa red, API externa o cloud export.\",\n    \"Quality Gate no consume audit-pack-integrity.\"\n  ],\n  \"risks\": [\n    \"Implemented-initial: no cifra ni firma audit packs.\",\n    \"No implementa colaboración cloud ni multiusuario real.\",\n    \"Runtime DB export queda bloqueado hasta ADR futura de cifrado/retención/consentimiento.\",\n    \"SecretGuard es determinístico y no reemplaza un secret scanner industrial completo.\"\n  ],\n  \"next_sprint\": \"FUNC-SPRINT-97\"\n}",
